---
import Section from '../../layout/Section.astro';
---

<Section contained={false} spacing="none" class="tax-explainer"><div class="garna-container"><span data-translate="info.kicker">Understand the full picture</span><h2 data-translate="info.title">From gross offer to money in your account</h2><div class="tax-steps"><article><b>01</b><h3 data-translate="info.grossTitle">Enter gross salary</h3><p data-translate="info.grossText">Choose the location, pay period and offer currency.</p></article><article><b>02</b><h3 data-translate="info.taxTitle">Apply local deductions</h3><p data-translate="info.taxText">The estimate accounts for country and regional tax logic.</p></article><article><b>03</b><h3 data-translate="info.netTitle">Review take-home pay</h3><p data-translate="info.netText">See annual net income and a transparent deduction breakdown.</p></article></div></div></Section>
